WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Less planning friction. More room for the trip. An AI-assisted travel-planning web app concept.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Start with the traveler’s context. Destination, dates, and the kind of trip.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Ideas, itinerary, and map. Together. A proposed workspace for reviewing and shaping a trip.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Review the plan. Share the adventure. A design concept, not a live booking or transaction service.
